# No code comments

Never add comments, doc comments, MARK lines, docstrings or commented-out
code, and delete the comments in code you change. Keep only text a tool reads
(shebangs, tool-version, lint and compiler directives, `nogncheck`, a printed
`__doc__`) and licence notices for copied code. Don't edit an engine input from
`Engine/ParcHost/overlay.json` just to strip comments; when you already change
one, strip Parc's comments in it, never Chromium's own lines.
See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#no-code-comments).
